Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Assemble a reconciled responsibility matrix and commercial comparison using accepted clarifications. Recheck all required functions and dependencies, expose residual gaps, and bind the selection packet to the exact bid editions reviewed.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
